| Regional Center      | Dallas, TX    | 10,000           | Local Carriers            |
| Regional Center      | Atlanta, GA   | 8,000            | UPS Supply Chain Solutions |

## 6. Conclusion

ABC Manufacturing Co. is committed to maintaining the highest standards in manufacturing, safety, packaging, and distribution. Our detailed protocols and dedicated teams ensure that we not only meet but exceed industry standards. Continuous improvement and adherence to safety practices remain at the forefront of our operations, allowing us to deliver quality products efficiently and safely to our customers. Moving forward, we will continue to invest in our processes and personnel to uphold our reputation as a leader in the industry.